{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51698","headline":"下狱有作 · 陈长官","name":"下狱有作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"按则增科不自由，未曾举笔泪先流。\n高田沙瘦常忧旱，沿海涂咸少有秋。\n要使茧丝殚地力，愿将骨肉伴枷头。\n一时种了黄连种，万代令人苦不休。\n（《古今图书集成·食货典》一五三《赋役部》）（〖1〗《十国春秋》卷八五：「陈长官，事武肃王爲宁海县令。\n会王命增州县赋税，长官上书极谏，王大怒，逮之狱。\n长官以死争之，得免。\n宁海故称剧县，租税视诸邑爲独轻者，皆其力也，至今犹庙祀焉。\n」与其诗相合。\n原收「无世次」卷，今移入本卷。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈长官","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51698.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51698","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}